    add('doc',24,3,'Which of the following is true about terraform apply? Pick 2 correct responses.','You must pass the output of a terraform plan command to it. || By default, it does not refresh state to reflect the current infrastructure. || Depending on provider specification, Terraform may need to destroy and recreate infrastructure resources. || You cannot target specific resources for the operation. || It only operates on infrastructure defined in the current working directory or workspace.','CE','C is valid, but E is misleading: apply also destroys tracked resources removed from configuration and can apply a saved plan.',note='Source option E is overbroad and conflicts with deletion behavior. Retained pending wording review.')
